# ==========================================================================
# Assurity Web Guardian — root .gitignore
#
# Primary purpose (Requirement 8 "No Secrets In The Public Repository"):
# keep tokens, keys, credentials, and local environment files out of the
# public repository. Any value the Cloud_Runner needs is supplied only as a
# GitHub Actions encrypted secret (Action_Secret) — never a committed file.
#
# NOTE: dist/ and artifacts/ are intentionally NOT ignored here. Their
# handling is governed by other in-flight phase-2 work (e.g. raw run
# artifacts move to the runs-data branch later). Do not add them without
# coordinating with that work.
# ==========================================================================

# --- Secrets / credentials / environment (Req 8.1, 8.3, 8.4) --------------
# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env

# Generic secret / credential bundles
*.secret
secrets.*
*.secrets
credentials
credentials.*
*.credentials
auth.json

# Keys and certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cert
*.crt
*.der
*.keystore
*.jks
id_rsa
id_rsa.*
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.*

# Cloud / tool credential caches commonly found in a working tree
.npmrc
.netrc
.aws/
.gcloud/
*.gpg
*.asc

# --- Dependencies ----------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/

# --- Logs & local scratch output ------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
# Stray local scratch logs/notes seen in the working tree
_*.log
_*.txt

# --- Generated publish bundle (task 13.1) ----------------------------------
# The local published Pages bundle (Req 6.7) is build output assembled from
# artifacts/runs + dashboard/ + the replay office build. It is generated on
# every successful local run and must never be committed. Staging/backup
# siblings created during the atomic swap are also transient.
# NOTE: this narrowly ignores ONLY the generated bundle under artifacts/, not
# artifacts/ as a whole (raw runs are handled by the runs-data branch work).
artifacts/published/
artifacts/published.staging/
artifacts/published.prev-*/
# CI Pages staging dir (assembled in the workflow, never committed)
_site/
# Virtual_Office Vite build output (replay bundle / local office build)
virtual-office/dist/

# --- Test / tooling runtime noise ------------------------------------------
test-results/
.playwright/
playwright/.cache/
.vitest/
coverage/

# --- Editor / OS files -----------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
*.local

# --- Generated build + raw run artifacts (kept OFF main) -------------------
# Phase 2 complete: raw per-run artifacts are published to the runs-data
# branch by CI and the Pages site; they are large (hundreds of MB) and
# regenerated each run, so they are NOT committed to main. dist/ is compiled
# build output (reproducible via 'npm run build'). virtual-office-src/ is a
# superseded copy of office sources now living under virtual-office/src/.
dist/
artifacts/
virtual-office-src/
